Gloss:  
Mzli lcde — I went there;  
pibo mz Rik — I said to Rik;  
kx natwz-mouki — that he was from the village of Natwz-mouki;  
du letz kcng — because he was the one who taught;  
tzrtctxngr mz alfabet ngr Natqgu — the alphabet of the Natqgu.

A translation for this Gitksan sentence in English is: ###I went there, I said to Rik that he was from the village of Natwz-mouki, because he was the one
